  fhir:ValueSet.description [ fhir:value "The Value Set is used for coding s specific allergen or other agent/substance (drug, food, chemical agent, etc.) to which the patient has an adverse reaction propensity.\nIt is defined as the union of:\n(a) eHDSIAllergenNoDrug\n(b) DLP_lecivePripravky\n(c) DLP_ATC\n(d) eHDSIAbsentOrUnknownAllergy\n(e) eHDSIExceptionalValue"] ;
